report:
We recommend checking the sentences below, and add any missing effect sizes.
For t-tests with a reported d, coherence checks yielded 1 indeterminate case.

```{r}
#| echo: false


# table data --------------------------------------
table <- structure(list(c("At ∆t = 1 d the DPH means exceed the corresponding continuous-time Erlang means, so estimates must be converted before they are compared with continuous-time ones.", 
"Left: transmission rate β (per step, ∆t = 1 d) under Scenarios A (full line list; solid) and B (infection times only; dashed)."
)), names = "", row.names = c(NA, -2L), class = "data.frame")

# display table -----------------------------------
metacheck::report_table(table, "auto", 2, FALSE)
```
